7bf3de42-903b-53ca-a3b8-b88d596c1126	Analytics	get content ID on your song with AdRrev or HAAWK/Identifyy (previous name of the website…find the new name) to monitor other’s usage (Don’t get it through your distributors DSP because you won’t be able to whitelist other’s channels!!!!): https://www.foximusic.com/what-is-adrev-youtube-content-id-and-adrev-explained/\n\ndo I through a 3rd party as discussed there: https://youtu.be/jIrkUsUiGwo?si=Y10aT9At8O4yEXPK&t=860\nImportant: Beat used for content ID and Sync should not have content ID…so you’ll have to remove them). Also make sure you get a contentID that has no wait on it if you need to remove it for music licensing…so either AdRev or Haawk doesn’t have a wait to check:\nhttps://youtu.be/jIrkUsUiGwo?si=mZs5x0kTHnWYSF82&t=1035\nDon’t get it through your distributors DSP because you won’t be able to whitelist other’s channels: https://youtu.be/jIrkUsUiGwo?si=Skox4M1Ur0qionfu&t=1459	get content ID on your song with AdRrev or HAAWK/Identifyy (previous name of the website…find the new name) to monitor other’s usage (Don’t get it through your distributors DSP because you won’t be able to whitelist other’s channels!!!!): https://www.foximusic.com/what-is-adrev-youtube-content-id-and-adrev-explained/\n\ndo I through a 3rd party as discussed there: https://youtu.be/jIrkUsUiGwo?si=Y10aT9At8O4yEXPK&t=860\nImportant: Beat used for content ID and Sync should not have content ID…so you’ll have to remove them). Also make sure you get a contentID that has no wait on it if you need to remove it for music licensing…so either AdRev or Haawk doesn’t have a wait to check:\nhttps://youtu.be/jIrkUsUiGwo?si=mZs5x0kTHnWYSF82&t=1035\nDon’t get it through your distributors DSP because you won’t be able to whitelist other’s channels: https://youtu.be/jIrkUsUiGwo?si=Skox4M1Ur0qionfu&t=1459	\N	t	{"notion_page_id": "23400a94-076a-80de-8438-f89032e762d2", "source_text": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jIrkUsUiGwo&t=623s", "source_urls": ["https