0c2e5d24-a04a-5b2c-8b06-a400455cbea1	Content ideas-operations	first week song promotion strategy	Slide 1 (Day 1)\n# DAY 1 (TUESDAY)\n\n## Release Day - GO ALL OUT\n\n✅ Release song on all streaming platforms\n\n✅ Release MVV (minimal motion to keep attention)\n\n✅ Email + text your list at midnight\n\n✅ First SFV: Introduce yourself (it pins to top on TikTok)\n\n✅ Drive people to Spotify (crucial for algorithm)\n\n✅ Make carousel post on Instagram (3–9 images, vulnerable caption)\n\n✅ Flood social media today\n\nSlide 2 (Days 2–3)\n# DAYS 2–3\n\n## Day 2 (Wednesday)\n\n✅ Tell song’s story on Instagram grid post\n\n✅ Post another SFV (audience-finding video)\n\n✅ Send audio messages to fans who shared in stories (not public reshares)\n\n✅ Post stories to Twitter/X, Threads, Bluesky\n\n## Day 3 (Thursday)\n\n✅ Continue posting SFVs and stories\n\n✅ Keep cycling through your content types\n\nSlide 3 (Days 4–7)\n# DAYS 4–7\n\n## Day 4 (Friday)\n\n✅ Update Spotify artist playlist with new genre releases\n\n✅ Share playlist, tag artists on socials\n\n✅ Add MVV to your YouTube singles playlist\n\n✅ Post another SFV (BTS or personality)\n\n## Days 5–6 (Weekend)\n\n✅ Light promo — personality posts\n\n✅ Emotional call-to-actions (not just "out now")\n\n✅ Show how people could be feeling with your track\n\n## Day 7 (Monday)\n\n✅ Facebook post, share to Instagram stories\n\n✅ Tell another variation of song’s story\n\n✅ Cross-promote platforms\n\nSlide 4 (Days 8–14)\n# DAYS 8–14\n\n## Day 8\n\n✅ Tell people something vulnerable tied to the song\n\n## Day 9\n\n✅ Find ways to contextualize the video\n\n✅ Grab imagery, post while song plays\n\n✅ Almost done with audience-finding videos\n\n## Day 10\n\n✅ Same mindset as Day 9\n\n## Day 11 (Friday)\n\n✅ Update second Spotify playlist (local scene/themed)\n\n✅ Promote it\n\n## Days 12–13 (Weekend)\n\n✅ Same as previous weekend\n\n✅ Post late night (10pm–12am) for late night scrollers\n\n## Day 14\n\n✅ Push Triblly: trade cover/alternate/unreleased for emails/texts\n\n✅ Get Spotify follows for Release Radar\n\n✅ Share any press you’ve gotten\n\nSlide 5 (Day 15 – First Checkpoint)\n**# DAY 15 -\n\nFIRST CHECKPOINT**\nRelease Lyric Video/Visualizer\n\nDecision Time\n\nSong performing badly?\nStart cycling in old songs that performed better\n\nSong doing well?\nDecide: Stick to 6-week promo or extend promo to 8 weeks?	\N	t	{"notion_page_id": "31600a94-076a-80e9-a96a-ed60f0b64cc8", "source_text": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DT1mCjolTgd/?utm_source=ig_web_copy_link&igsh=MzRlODBiNWFlZA==", "source_urls": ["https://www.instagram.com/p/DT1mCjolTgd/?utm_source=ig_web_copy_link&igsh=MzRlODBiNWFlZA%3D%3D", "https://www.instagram.com/p/DT1mCjolTgd/?utm_source=ig_web_copy_link&igsh=MzRlODBiNWFlZA=="], "tags": [], "files": [{"name": "Screenshot 2026-03-05 at 11.42.15\\u202fPM.png", "url": "https://prod-files-secure.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/466167cc-af2f-4395-b695-40f870b23efa/47cfa458-20c5-4e3d-bf3f-9076ed48cf6c/Screenshot_2026-03-05_at_11.42.15_PM.png?X-Amz-Algorithm=AWS4-HMAC-SHA256&X-Amz-Content-Sha256=UNSIGNED-PAYLOAD&X-Amz-Credential=ASIAZI2LB46663QAYAXV%2F20260322%2Fus-west-2%2Fs3%2Faws4_request&X-Amz-Date=20260322T165844Z&X-Amz-Expires=3600&X-Amz-Security-Token=IQoJb3JpZ2luX2VjEJz%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2FwEaCXVzLXdlc3QtMiJIMEYCIQDcqC2AHXYJ1nqq5hGGY6ZoJJTXImFJ78AiKVZqXxSQVwIhAK6JbcWZiTsZoavCClIhxdgR3ppVfYTtOdIyT2TDWG6xKv8DCGUQABoMNjM3NDIzMTgzODA1IgyNu8crgZ7YuwVT%2FAAq3AMWZVcEXAkcpkCLZeT54nHjdskABIT0GBxfH5aapWh5Fz8mlDFdW5Hv9xYTN%2BtIBD3UKunnpmoFMQ2rUJkd5srG%2FJyEJO5wmE4E9OehkqA4bPxqLozcVORI8ueDXBfg630%2FR%2BgiGpCAWX%2BWghfgElny%2B4nFBjZB8nqg%2FlliKio7tecTWvv1%2B7cCBLFjkY%2FZRzRXtmQSUFtbn5F96WWgbusmq1vTleXIx6zj4rzD1M%2BNejMD9tJtDfOoDopRsmhocZX6ii%2BngVnK1PVi%2FyaP%2B3erruUb6j3jTipA1Mh%2Fvp30IJ7xnZIJdYY8tWieOQ1xoh5w2nyPuNYT1wGCna%2BgsjatL6h4%2Bzjo74awBb2SlBf1fXAyrMrqLZ34hAYCTo%2BaBung%2FIbjXMo7hA5nLF4FpUij2ilL%2BrfsQikroWZNUTYsHEMRMxZzF7hFo4Vj63emgcrFaqZco%2FmCEhwYEHtqGqUKP7%2Bl6I1sanu910K4n3ZwCWZ2